                <ul>
                    <li><strong>No devices found after scan</strong> — check the device is plugged in and that Windows Device Manager shows it without a yellow warning icon.</li>
                    <li><strong>SDRplay not detected</strong> — open <em>services.msc</em> and confirm <em>SDRplay API Service</em> is running.</li>
                    <li><strong>Spectrum looks wrong / distorted</strong> — check your IF frequency setting matches the radio (FTdx101: 9,000,000 Hz).</li>
